// expect: RenderTarget.Cube is 'Cubemap' now: a Cubemap has a constructor of its own, as RenderTarget has
// expect: 'Cubemap(256)' is a cube whose six faces are drawn into, and 'Cubemap(256, Format.Rgba16f)' one that holds floats
// From the afternoon a cube was made through RenderTarget
scene Main { }
local singleton Room { Cubemap reflection; RenderTarget side; List<Vertex3> ball; }
view Show(mut Room room) { room.reflection = RenderTarget.Cube(64); }
